{title: 572 - Give of Your Best to the Master}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #572 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 572}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb/Bb]Give of your best [Bb7]to [Eb/Bb]the [Bb]Master,
[Bb7/Ab]Give of [Gm]the [Cm/G]strength of [Fm/Ab]your [Eb/Bb]youth;
[Fm/C]Throw your [Eb/Bb]soul’s fresh, [Dm/A]glowing [Bb]ardor
[Eb/Bb]Into the [Bb7]battle [Bb]for truth.
[Gb/Db]Jesus [C7]has set [Fm/C]the [Ab]example—
[Eb/Bb]Dauntless was [Bb7/Ab]He, young [Cm/G]and brave;
[Cm]Give Him [Gm]your [Cm/G]loyal devotion,
[Cm]Give Him the [Bdim]best [Bm]that [Cm]you [Bdim]have.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[Cm/G]Give of your [Bb/F]best to the [Cm/Eb]master,
[Cm]Give of the strength of [Fm/C]your [Cm]youth;
[Cm]Clad in salvation's [Bb]full armor,
[Bb]Join in [Am]the [Bb]battle [F]for [Bb7]truth.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb/Bb]Give of your best [Bb7]to [Eb/Bb]the [Bb]Master,
[Bb7/Ab]Give Him [Gm]first [Cm/G]place in [Fm/Ab]your [Eb/Bb]heart;
[Fm/C]Give Him [Eb/Bb]first place [Dm/A]in your [Bb]service,
[Eb/Bb]Consecrate [Bb7]every [Bb]part.
[Gb/Db]Give, and [C7]to you [Fm/C]shall [Ab]be given [Bb7/Ab]-
[Eb/Bb]God His [Bb7/Ab]beloved [Cm/G]Son gave;
[Cm]Gratefully seeking to [Fm/C]serve [Cm]Him,
[Cm]Give Him the [Bdim]best [Bm]that [Cm]you [Bdim]have.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Eb/Bb]Give of your best [Bb7]to [Eb/Bb]the [Bb]Master,
[Bb7/Ab]Naught else [Gm]is [Cm/G]worthy [Fm/Ab]His [Eb/Bb]love;
[Fm/C]He gave [Eb/Bb]Himself [Dm/A]for your [Bb]ransom,
[Eb/Bb]Have up His [Bb7]glory [Bb]above;
[Gb/Db]Laid down [C7]His life [Fm/C]without [Ab]murmur,
[Eb/Bb]You from [Bb7/Ab]sin's ruin [Cm/G]to save;
[Cm]Give Him your [Gm]heart's [Cm/G]adoration,
[Cm]Give Him the [Bdim]best [Bm]that [Cm]you [Bdim]have.
{end_of_verse}
